{"seq":2,"slug":"functions","title":"函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-concept","title":"高一数学 — 函数概念与性质","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/function-concept","wordCount":1719,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"exponential-log","title":"高一数学 — 指数与对数函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/exponential-log","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"trigonometric-functions","title":"高一数学 — 三角函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/trigonometric-functions","wordCount":1440,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"函数-简介\">函数 简介</h1><p>本章是高一数学的核心内容，函数的思想贯穿整个高中数学乃至高等数学。高一阶段需要完成从初中&quot;变量之间的对应关系&quot;到高中&quot;集合之间的映射&quot;这一概念跃迁，并系统掌握指数函数、对数函数和三角函数的图像与性质，形成分析函数问题的完整方法体系。</p>\n<p>本章包含三个小节。<strong>函数概念与基本性质</strong>从函数的严格定义出发，讲解定义域、值域的求法，系统分析函数的单调性、奇偶性和周期性三大基本性质，并介绍函数图像的平移、对称和伸缩变换，帮助学生建立从解析式到图像、从图像到性质的双向分析能力。<strong>指数函数与对数函数</strong>先回顾指数运算法则和对数的定义，然后分别讲解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = a^x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\log_a x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的图像特征与性质规律，重点突出指数函数与对数函数互为反函数的内在联系，并通过复合函数的单调性分析训练综合运用能力。<strong>三角函数</strong>从弧度制和三角函数的定义切入，系统讲解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span></span></span></span></span> 的图像和性质，涵盖周期、振幅、相位等关键概念，以及三角函数图像变换的方法，为后续解三角形和三角恒等变换奠定基础。</p>\n<p>建议先牢固掌握函数概念和基本性质，这是分析一切具体函数的通用框架。指数与对数函数可以对照学习，两者互为逆运算的关系有助于加深理解。三角函数部分内容较多，建议结合函数图像的画图练习加深记忆。</p>\n"}